{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16212372","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16212372","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1621237201:0":{"text":"함정과 독성 과일을 뿌린 것도 설마...?","source_cn":"那些陷阱、毒果都是你们放的吧……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AE68DD5C0EFCDDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621237202:1":{"text":"흐흐, 우리 똑똑이가 드디어 눈치챈 모양이군?","source_cn":"哼哼，看看咱们的大聪明，终于反应过来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8025DF2085D8CABF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621237203:1":{"text":"계속 약해진 동물들만 데려가야 한다는 계약 타령을 했잖아?","source_cn":"你不是非要搞什么契约吗？什么只能带走体弱动物的蠢规矩——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A37195F2E083F5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621237204:0":{"text":"그러니까 우리가 데려갈 수 있도록 약해지게 “도와준” 것뿐이야.","source_cn":"我当然得“帮”它们虚弱一点，才能顺理成章地带走。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C19BCC52B40201E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1621237205:0":{"text":"비열하군요!","source_cn":"卑劣至极。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23E837781128D95A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1621237206:0":{"text":"하, 네가 피리를 불면서 한 비열한 짓은? 이건 칭찬으로 듣지.","source_cn":"哈！你吹笛人做的下三滥事还少吗？我这就当你在夸我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x662A01B8CDEFD0C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1621237207:0":{"text":"어차피 계약을 지킬 생각도 없으면서 이런 연극은 왜 한 겁니까?","source_cn":"既然你们不打算尊重契约，又何必演这出戏？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9FE883CEBDF2B19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1621237208:1":{"text":"흥, 보스가 널 감싸주지 않았다면 그 망할 계약 따위 누가 신경이나 쓰겠나?","source_cn":"哼，要不是老板护着你，谁管你什么狗屁契约？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFA581DACF3D015F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1621237209:0":{"text":"하지만 보스가 원하는 건... 고래라고!","source_cn":"但是老板要的——是大鲸鱼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F965BDA40168526","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1621237210:0":{"text":"두목, 그냥 고래가 아니라 강돌고래...","source_cn":"头儿，那不是大鲸鱼，是江豚……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC93A7DFBCDB27ED1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1621237211:0":{"text":"라이세움에는 애초에 강돌고래가 없다고요...","source_cn":"莱希拉姆根本就没有江豚……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5270635F6B6560E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1621237212:0":{"text":"뭐? 우리가 고생고생해서 널 라이세움까지 끌고 온 게 고작 빌빌거리는 다람쥐 몇 마리 때문이겠어?","source_cn":"什么！？我们千里迢迢把你送来莱希拉姆，难道就为了这几只...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87A8AB278FA2D0E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1621237213:0":{"text":"무슨 말을 하는지 모르겠군요. 저는 계약에 따라 동물들을 구하고 있을 뿐입니다. 약재도 거의 다 떨어졌으니, 대금은 서둘러 정산해 주시죠.","source_cn":"我不懂你在说什么，我只是按契约救助这些动物，药材快用完...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96B5B435F8922A59","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1621237214:0":{"text":"흥... 강돌고래가 없다면 우린 모두 죽은 목숨이야.","source_cn":"哼……要是没见到江豚，我们谁都别想活着回去交差。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x935FBEE0B110B89E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1621237215:0":{"text":"강돌고래를 찾아드리겠다고 약속한 적은 없는데요.","source_cn":"我从来没承诺过会找到江豚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0BB96D26512CC9AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1621237216:0":{"text":"좋아, 그럼 가서 직접 찾아보시지. 물속에서도 그렇게 큰소리칠 수 있는지 보자고!","source_cn":"好啊，那你就去水里找吧，看看在水下你还能不能嘴硬！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB04D7B0DA340023B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1621237217:0":{"text":"얘들아, 던져라!","source_cn":"小的们，把他丢进湖里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC98EE9DF28AC6CB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1621237218:0":{"text":"하지만... 두목, 하멜은 보스가 꽤 아끼는 녀석 아닙니까. 무슨 일이라도 생기면...","source_cn":"这……头儿，可是……老板对哈梅尔先生非常看重，要是出了事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E68CE765C691F00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1621237219:0":{"text":"내가 책임진다! 당장 던져! 강돌고래가 어디 있는지 말 못 하겠다면 물에 들어가서 직접 찾아오라고 해. 못 찾으면 땅에 올라올 생각은 하지 마라!","source_cn":"我来担责！动手！既然他说不出江豚在哪，就让他下去慢慢找...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39D4583BB9FDBB15","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1621237220:0":{"text":"전부 미쳤군요... 강돌고래를 본 적이 없다고 하지 않았습니까. 이럴 수는...","source_cn":"你们疯了吗……我说了，我真的没见过江豚！不能这样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C36C22238876343","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:哈梅尔":{"text":"하멜","source":"哈梅尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:不耐烦的流氓":{"text":"신경질적인 건달","source":"不耐烦的流氓","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:憨厚的流氓":{"text":"우직한 건달","source":"憨厚的流氓","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":21,"localized_text_count":20,"speaker_count":3}}